[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9722.469, "timestamp": "02:42:02", "text": "学习它们，并将它们运用到我的生活中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9724.87, "timestamp": "02:42:04", "text": "工作流程等等。就是这样吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.11, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "值得称赞吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9734.55, "timestamp": "02:42:14", "text": "技术方面的东西，所有的一切。老兄，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.27, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "至今仍记得那些事。太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9739.59, "timestamp": "02:42:19", "text": "你还记得吗？呃，有这么一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9741.67, "timestamp": "02:42:21", "text": "你直播的时候聊天的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9745.389, "timestamp": "02:42:25", "text": "控制某个东西。我们都必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9749.27, "timestamp": "02:42:29", "text": "输入所有字母或向上滚动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9751.59, "timestamp": "02:42:31", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。我的天啊，那真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.71, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "乐趣。是啊，那真有趣。我还记得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9757.11, "timestamp": "02:42:37", "text": "那样做，我不得不琢磨一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9759.59, "timestamp": "02:42:39", "text": "把事情处理妥当，然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9761.349, "timestamp": "02:42:41", "text": "必须制作这张图表，以便每个人都能看懂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9763.99, "timestamp": "02:42:43", "text": "知道喜欢什么，并会如何使用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.83, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "控制我的角色和一切。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9769.349, "timestamp": "02:42:49", "text": "那真是太有趣了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9771.87, "timestamp": "02:42:51", "text": "是啊，那真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9777.11, "timestamp": "02:42:57", "text": "那段时光既美好又独特。是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9779.87, "timestamp": "02:42:59", "text": "所有这些操作都是在 Streamboard 中完成的。"}]